Package: rtemis.dplot3
Title: Interactive 'plotly' Graphics for the 'rtemis' Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-13
Authors@R: person(given = "E.D.", family = "Gennatas", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), 
    email = "gennatas@gmail.com", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9280-3609"))
Description: Interactive 'plotly', 'networkD3', 'threejs' and 'leaflet' graphics: scatter, 3D
    scatter, bar, box, density, heatmap, pie, calibration, confusion matrix, ROC, survival,
    time series, spectrogram, volcano, protein annotation, network, map and table plots, with
    'rtemis' themes and palettes. These functions began as part of the 'rtemis' package
    (<doi:10.32614/CRAN.package.rtemis>); 'rtemis.draw' provides their successors.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
URL: https://www.rtemis.org, https://github.com/rtemis-org/rtemis.dplot3
